; Component:       parser
; Module:          dune
; Owning Team:     Arithmetic Excellence Center (AEC)
; Classification:  INTERNAL
; Purpose:         Build settings shared by every directory of the service:
;                  all compiler warnings are errors in every profile, and
;                  odoc warnings fail the documentation build.
; Related Docs:    services/parser/README.md, ADR-0015

; Warnings: the default set of dune plus 44/45 (open shadowing) disabled, and
; every enabled warning is an error, including 50 (misplaced documentation
; comment), so that a doc comment always documents the definition below it.

(env
 (_
  (flags
   (:standard -w +a-4-40-41-42-44-45-70 -warn-error +a))
  (odoc
   (warnings fatal))))
